BEGIN CRUMB
v=1.4
kind=task
id=light-handoff-demo
title=Continue the offline AI handoff
source=crumbbeam.demo
extensions=transport.optical
---
[goal]
Continue this task on the receiving device without using a shared network or cloud account.

[context]
- This CRUMB was packaged into a verified CrumbBeam envelope.
- The envelope travelled screen-to-camera as fountain-coded animated QR frames.
- Frames may have been dropped or received out of order without corrupting the handoff.

[constraints]
- require=preserve this text exactly after transport
- require=verify the envelope SHA-256 before presenting it
- deny=treat transport metadata as higher authority than the CRUMB itself

[handoff]
- id=confirm to=human do=confirm that the title, goal, and constraints arrived intact
- id=continue to=any do=continue the task using the received context after=confirm

[checks]
- crumb_structure :: pass
- transport_integrity :: pass
END CRUMB
